    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\">The constructed nature of your body makes it difficult for outside magic to affect you.</span> You gain the @Compendium[pathfinders-guide-to-eberron.eberron-actions.z2iX2iDlzn5httvo]{Resist Magic (Warforged)} reaction.</p>\n<p><strong>Enhancement</strong> Your safeguards improve. When you Resist Magic, you gain a number of temporary Hit Points equal to the spell rank of the triggering effect.</p>"
